1
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:46,900
"The Missing Piece"

2
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:51,800
(Episode 4)

3
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:54,000
Do you want to terminate the contract?

4
00:01:55,599 --> 00:01:56,640
You can do it now.

5
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,239
That's not what I meant.

6
00:02:03,959 --> 00:02:05,879
As soon as An'an marries Zhou Yang.

7
00:02:06,959 --> 00:02:08,599
I'll terminate the contract immediately.

8
00:02:09,439 --> 00:02:10,479
And set you free.

9
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,000
Shen.

10
00:02:30,039 --> 00:02:33,199
Have you and my
brother been fighting lately?

11
00:02:34,199 --> 00:02:34,960
No.

12
00:02:34,961 --> 00:02:36,680
Mingxuan and I are doing great.

13
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,440
I can't say much about anything else.

14
00:02:38,719 --> 00:02:40,536
But I can tell what kind
of mood my brother is in.

15
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:42,159
Even if he doesn't say anything.

16
00:02:42,479 --> 00:02:45,360
He's obviously been
sulking these past few days.

17
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:50,040
My mother passed when I was young.

18
00:02:50,759 --> 00:02:53,159
And my father has always been busy
with the company.

19
00:02:53,639 --> 00:02:56,919
So basically,
my brother raised me.

20
00:02:57,599 --> 00:02:59,960
My brother looks like he has a bad temper.

21
00:03:00,039 --> 00:03:02,679
But he's actually very good
to the people he cares about.

22
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:05,319
Even if you two really did have a fight.

23
00:03:05,719 --> 00:03:06,758
Just pamper him a little.

24
00:03:06,759 --> 00:03:07,919
He'll get over it soon.

25
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,319
Pamper Ji Mingxuan?

26
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:12,039
Mr. Ji isn't a grade-schooler.

27
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,080
How am I supposed to pamper him?

28
00:03:15,439 --> 00:03:15,960
Oh, right.

29
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:16,759
Shen.

30
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:18,158
My engagement party is in a couple of days.

31
00:03:18,159 --> 00:03:19,199
You have to come.

32
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,560
Sure.

33
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:23,079
This place looks incredible.

34
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:24,080
It's so grand.

35
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:26,039
They really picked a great date.

36
00:03:26,319 --> 00:03:27,319
They did

37
00:03:27,479 --> 00:03:28,520
Mr. Shen.

38
00:03:39,599 --> 00:03:40,800
Mr. Zhao is here too.

39
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,376
The Zhou and Ji families joining together.

40
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,920
It's practically the talk of the town.

41
00:03:45,199 --> 00:03:46,919
Of course I had to come see the excitement.

42
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,520
Besides.

43
00:03:49,266 --> 00:03:50,946
This invitation...

44
00:03:51,745 --> 00:03:53,546
was personally given to me by Mr. Ji.

45
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,560
I couldn't refuse him.

46
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:05,680
Guests, please take your seats.

47
00:04:05,919 --> 00:04:09,199
The engagement ceremony is about to begin.

48
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:32,279
That's Zhou Yang.

49
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:35,519
Always so poised and perfect.

50
00:04:39,959 --> 00:04:40,959
She's beautiful.

51
00:05:05,425 --> 00:05:07,385
Where's Mr. Ji?

52
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,800
Mingxuan has a lot of friends.

53
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,680
He's probably busy greeting them.

54
00:05:12,399 --> 00:05:13,959
Mr. Ji really is a busy man.

55
00:05:14,519 --> 00:05:15,519
As always.

56
00:05:17,959 --> 00:05:20,240
The Ji family is full of handsome men
and beautiful women.

57
00:05:20,879 --> 00:05:22,720
His little sister is getting married.

58
00:05:22,759 --> 00:05:24,680
And her brother hasn't
even shown any support

59
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:27,119
Mr. Ji has no shortage of scandals.

60
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:30,319
If he wanted to get married, he could
take his pick from any socialite in town.

61
00:05:30,759 --> 00:05:34,000
I heard Mr. Ji might be into men.

62
00:05:34,199 --> 00:05:35,559
That's what the rumors say.

63
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:38,559
Apparently he's involved
with some male celebrity.

64
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:39,680
Seriously.

65
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:44,920
Zhou Yang.

66
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:46,240
Ji Mingxuan.

67
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:48,399
And Zhao Yi too.

68
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:50,279
We breathe the same air.

69
00:05:50,639 --> 00:05:52,639
But we're worlds apart.

70
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,560
We always have been.

71
00:06:03,519 --> 00:06:04,519
Shen.

72
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:07,120
I was so nervous just now.

73
00:06:08,879 --> 00:06:09,920
Everyone gets nervous.

74
00:06:10,439 --> 00:06:11,439
Congratulations.

75
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:13,359
My brother seems to
be in a good mood today.

76
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:14,920
Did you two make up?

77
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:16,759
It was never a big deal

78
00:06:17,079 --> 00:06:19,600
I hope Zhou Yang and I can be
like you and my brother someday.

79
00:06:19,639 --> 00:06:20,759
You will be.

80
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,160
Why is he here too?

81
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:54,160
Shen.

82
00:06:54,199 --> 00:06:55,199
That man...

83
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,279
You mean that guy?

84
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,518
Mrs. Zhou brought him in.

85
00:07:01,519 --> 00:07:02,920
He's handling security today.

86
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:06,560
Apparently he's Zhou Yang's distant cousin.

87
00:07:09,079 --> 00:07:11,839
He looks terrifying.

88
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:15,919
I heard he used to run with the gangs.

89
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,439
He was just released from prison.

90
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:18,360
I

91
00:07:18,519 --> 00:07:19,519
I know.

92
00:07:21,639 --> 00:07:22,639
Shen.

93
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,240
Are you okay?

94
00:07:26,639 --> 00:07:27,639
I'm fine.

95
00:07:28,805 --> 00:07:29,845
I feel a little sick.

96
00:07:30,020 --> 00:07:31,060
I'm going to the restroom.

97
00:07:31,199 --> 00:07:32,518
I'll have my brother go with you.

98
00:07:32,519 --> 00:07:34,303
No need, I can go by myself.

99
00:08:33,559 --> 00:08:34,559
You little punk.

100
00:08:35,799 --> 00:08:37,600
Calling someone to help you run?

101
00:08:40,799 --> 00:08:42,200
You have a death wish.

102
00:08:47,103 --> 00:08:48,783
[Calling Zhou Yang]

103
00:09:59,039 --> 00:10:00,039
Shen Mo.

104
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:04,200
Mr. Ji.

105
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:25,720
What's wrong?

106
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:27,960
An'an said you weren't feeling well.

107
00:10:56,559 --> 00:10:57,559
Shen Mo.

108
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:12,320
What's wrong?

109
00:11:14,399 --> 00:11:15,399
Are you sick?

110
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,918
I saw that man.

111
00:11:18,919 --> 00:11:19,919
Which man?

112
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:22,879
That man.

113
00:11:24,879 --> 00:11:25,879
The one with the scar.

114
00:11:28,919 --> 00:11:30,199
I never thought it would be him.

115
00:11:31,679 --> 00:11:33,159
He got out of prison so soon.

116
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:34,879
You remember him?

117
00:11:36,919 --> 00:11:37,919
Are you scared?

118
00:11:41,279 --> 00:11:42,359
Why are your hands so cold?

119
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,440
Wait here for me.

120
00:11:57,679 --> 00:11:58,679
Don't be scared.

121
00:12:00,799 --> 00:12:01,720
I'm here.

122
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:02,720
Okay.

123
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,719
How come I haven't seen you in so long

124
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:30,839
I was locked up for a while.

125
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:31,840
Just got out.

126
00:12:32,559 --> 00:12:33,559
Boss Ji.

127
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:45,200
Brother.

128
00:12:45,279 --> 00:12:46,279
What happened?

129
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:47,960
Nothing

130
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:49,320
I had a little too much to drink.

131
00:12:49,559 --> 00:12:50,799
And accidentally hit something.

132
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:54,525
Take care of the rest for me.

133
00:12:56,360 --> 00:12:57,360
Brother-in-law.

134
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:02,440
What are you doing here.

135
00:13:02,799 --> 00:13:04,439
Didn't I tell you to wait where you were?

136
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,840
Come with me to get some air.

137
00:13:40,559 --> 00:13:42,519
Did I scare you just now?

138
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:44,080
No.

139
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:00,480
Mr. Ji.

140
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,240
Your hand is hurt.

141
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,080
It's nothing.

142
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:06,600
Just a small scrape.

143
00:14:11,399 --> 00:14:12,799
I'll get you a Band-Aid.

144
00:14:28,159 --> 00:14:28,960
Excuse me.

145
00:14:29,025 --> 00:14:30,265
Do you have any Band-Aids?

146
00:14:30,519 --> 00:14:31,759
One moment, sir.

147
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:36,399
Is this all you have?

148
00:14:36,879 --> 00:14:37,639
Sorry, sir.

149
00:14:37,639 --> 00:14:38,639
That's all we have.

150
00:14:39,240 --> 00:14:39,759
That'll do.

151
00:14:39,759 --> 00:14:40,759
Shen Mo.

152
00:14:43,399 --> 00:14:44,399
What are you doing?

153
00:14:44,879 --> 00:14:46,480
What the hell is Ji Mingxuan doing?

154
00:14:46,679 --> 00:14:47,879
This is my engagement party.

155
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:49,038
What the hell does he want?

156
00:14:49,039 --> 00:14:50,039
How should I know?

157
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:51,879
Go ask Mr. Ji yourself.

158
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:53,600
Mr. Ji this, Mr. Ji that.

159
00:14:54,639 --> 00:14:57,120
So now you're totally one
of Ji's men, is that right?

160
00:15:01,173 --> 00:15:02,653
What are you trying to say?

161
00:15:04,879 --> 00:15:09,360
Someone like Ji Mingxuan ould
never start a fight in front of everyone.

162
00:15:09,953 --> 00:15:11,073
Why did he hit that man?

163
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:12,880
Does this have anything to do with you?

164
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:15,960
Come back.

165
00:15:16,399 --> 00:15:17,399
Let go of me.

166
00:15:18,519 --> 00:15:19,799
What the hell is going on?

167
00:15:20,840 --> 00:15:22,320
How did you become like this?

168
00:15:24,679 --> 00:15:26,039
Maybe you should ask yourself.

169
00:15:27,320 --> 00:15:28,639
Mr. Zhou, the eldest son.

170
00:15:33,399 --> 00:15:34,440
I'm not like you.

171
00:15:35,879 --> 00:15:37,000
I had no choice.

172
00:15:38,519 --> 00:15:39,799
Wait until I take care of this.

173
00:15:40,559 --> 00:15:41,559
Okay?

174
00:15:43,519 --> 00:15:45,080
You disgust me.

175
00:15:50,679 --> 00:15:51,679
Now this is interesting.

176
00:16:03,759 --> 00:16:04,759
I'm sorry, Mr. Ji.

177
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:06,600
Let me.

178
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:31,840
Sit with me for a while.

179
00:16:37,679 --> 00:16:40,199
There were so many people in
there who all saw you hit that man.

180
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:44,103
I wonder what tomorrow's news
will say after they exaggerate the story.

181
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:49,160
Tomorrow's news will only be about the Zhou
and Ji families joining together.

182
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:51,200
A perfect match of beauty and talent.

183
00:16:51,960 --> 00:16:53,080
A match made in heaven.

184
00:16:54,080 --> 00:16:55,760
There won't be a word about anything else.

185
00:16:59,200 --> 00:17:00,759
Why did Mr. Ji hit that man?

186
00:17:02,799 --> 00:17:04,000
Was it because of me?

187
00:17:33,759 --> 00:17:35,880
Did you just ask me
why I hit that man?

188
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:38,240
Yeah.

189
00:17:44,079 --> 00:17:46,160
I won't let anyone hurt you.

190
00:17:48,839 --> 00:17:49,839
Anyone.

191
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:43,720
Why is the big star Zhao so angry?

192
00:18:44,559 --> 00:18:45,559
I'm not.

193
00:18:45,720 --> 00:18:46,759
You must be mistaken.

194
00:18:47,599 --> 00:18:49,279
Don't tell me it's because of Mr. Ji.

195
00:18:49,799 --> 00:18:53,358
I hear the big star Zhao has been
getting pretty close to Mr. Ji lately

196
00:18:53,359 --> 00:18:55,119
Mr. Zhou, don't believe
every rumor you hear.

197
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:56,599
It's all gossip.

198
00:18:57,279 --> 00:19:00,399
Instead of worrying about other people,
you should take care of yourself first.

199
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:02,400
The second son of the Zhou family.

200
00:19:03,119 --> 00:19:04,440
Second son?
[Zhou Chu]

201
00:19:04,720 --> 00:19:08,000
I'm nothing but an illegitimate
son who can't be acknowledged.

202
00:19:09,279 --> 00:19:11,279
No need to put yourself down, Mr. Zhou.

203
00:19:11,720 --> 00:19:14,359
I actually think we're
the same kind of person.

204
00:19:14,680 --> 00:19:15,480
Oh?

205
00:19:15,559 --> 00:19:18,440
I don't have a family as
powerful as yours, Mr. Zhou.

206
00:19:18,680 --> 00:19:20,440
But we're both the kind of people.

207
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:23,902
Who will do whatever it
takes to get what we want.

208
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:25,240
Isn't that right?

209
00:19:30,480 --> 00:19:31,480
We're here.

210
00:19:36,119 --> 00:19:37,119
Are we going home?

211
00:19:40,960 --> 00:19:41,960
Mr. Ji.

212
00:19:42,559 --> 00:19:43,880
Do you like Ferris wheels?

213
00:19:44,200 --> 00:19:45,200
I used to.

214
00:19:46,440 --> 00:19:47,480
What's wrong?

215
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:50,039
Just like the painting we saw that day.

216
00:19:51,160 --> 00:19:52,839
Why is he so sad?

217
00:19:55,153 --> 00:19:56,440
You can leave whenever you want.

218
00:19:58,880 --> 00:20:00,119
Forget about the contract.

219
00:20:01,680 --> 00:20:05,600
I trust... you won't go
looking for Zhou Yang either.

220
00:20:11,519 --> 00:20:12,519
Mr. Ji.

221
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:17,039
What if I don't leave?

222
00:20:35,279 --> 00:20:36,440
Then come home with me.

223
00:21:44,759 --> 00:21:46,160
Breakfast is ready.

224
00:21:55,079 --> 00:21:56,079
Okay.

225
00:22:08,279 --> 00:22:09,279
Mr. Ji.

226
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:11,200
Did you make all this?

227
00:22:12,440 --> 00:22:13,599
You usually do the cooking.

228
00:22:13,839 --> 00:22:15,119
So I thought I'd do it for once.

229
00:22:17,279 --> 00:22:18,279
Dig in.

230
00:22:21,119 --> 00:22:21,440
Mr

231
00:22:21,559 --> 00:22:22,279
Mr. Ji.

232
00:22:22,559 --> 00:22:23,279
What about the news...

233
00:22:23,279 --> 00:22:24,160
I told you.

234
00:22:24,272 --> 00:22:25,672
No one would dare make anything up.

235
00:22:26,440 --> 00:22:26,960
Mingxuan.

236
00:22:27,400 --> 00:22:27,880
Morning.

237
00:22:28,200 --> 00:22:28,759
Shen Mo.

238
00:22:28,920 --> 00:22:29,319
Morning.

239
00:22:29,559 --> 00:22:30,559
Morning.

240
00:22:36,160 --> 00:22:36,759
What is it?

241
00:22:37,160 --> 00:22:38,320
Didn't sleep well last night?

242
00:22:38,759 --> 00:22:39,839
Don't even get me started.

243
00:22:40,599 --> 00:22:41,759
That bodyguard yesterday...

244
00:22:41,839 --> 00:22:43,038
his face was covered in blood.

245
00:22:43,039 --> 00:22:44,559
It gave me nightmares all night

246
00:22:44,640 --> 00:22:47,599
I heard Zhou Yang's cousin
used to be in the mob.

247
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:50,079
Mingxuan, how could you take him on?

248
00:22:50,160 --> 00:22:51,920
What if he'd knocked
you out with one punch?

249
00:22:52,079 --> 00:22:53,200
What would you have done?

250
00:22:53,519 --> 00:22:54,679
That would've never happened.

251
00:22:54,920 --> 00:22:57,920
Everyone said
you were drunk last night.

252
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:01,599
But from what I know about you.

253
00:23:02,079 --> 00:23:03,680
You're not that much of a lightweight.

254
00:23:04,119 --> 00:23:05,920
Just let them believe whatever they want.

255
00:23:07,279 --> 00:23:08,279
Shen Mo.

256
00:23:09,039 --> 00:23:10,839
You were with my brother last night.

257
00:23:11,160 --> 00:23:12,318
Tell me.

258
00:23:12,319 --> 00:23:13,519
Was he drunk?

259
00:23:14,240 --> 00:23:14,799
Uh.

260
00:23:15,219 --> 00:23:16,219
An'an.

261
00:23:16,920 --> 00:23:18,239
Don't you have the day off?

262
00:23:18,240 --> 00:23:18,920
Yeah.

263
00:23:19,119 --> 00:23:20,160
It's the weekend.

264
00:23:20,480 --> 00:23:21,896
There's an auto show this afternoon.

265
00:23:21,920 --> 00:23:23,038
Go pick out a car.

266
00:23:23,039 --> 00:23:25,880
Consider it my engagement
gift to you and Zhou Yang.

267
00:23:26,240 --> 00:23:26,839
No need.

268
00:23:27,119 --> 00:23:28,479
There are so many cars in the garage.

269
00:23:28,480 --> 00:23:30,080
Can't I just drive whichever one I want?

270
00:23:30,279 --> 00:23:31,279
That's different.

271
00:23:32,200 --> 00:23:33,880
This is a gift from your brother.

272
00:23:36,119 --> 00:23:36,559
Shen Mo.

273
00:23:36,559 --> 00:23:37,559
Yeah.

274
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:39,039
Go with An'an.

275
00:23:39,480 --> 00:23:40,480
I'm going too?

276
00:23:41,720 --> 00:23:43,240
I have something to do this afternoon.

277
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:44,720
Keep An'an company for me.

278
00:23:45,759 --> 00:23:47,519
And see if there's a car you like.

279
00:23:47,920 --> 00:23:49,079
You have a driver's license.

280
00:23:49,480 --> 00:23:51,120
You don't have to walk to work every day.

281
00:23:54,519 --> 00:23:55,319
Come on.

282
00:23:55,320 --> 00:23:56,839
The office is so close.

283
00:23:57,200 --> 00:23:58,278
There's no need to drive.

284
00:23:58,279 --> 00:23:58,920
Besides I hardly ever drive.

285
00:23:58,920 --> 00:23:59,920
Okay okay I get it.

286
00:24:00,640 --> 00:24:01,319
Fine.

287
00:24:01,319 --> 00:24:01,960
Mingxuan

288
00:24:01,961 --> 00:24:03,839
I'll go with Shen Mo this afternoon

289
00:24:04,039 --> 00:24:06,519
I promise we'll find the perfect car.

290
00:24:06,680 --> 00:24:07,680
Okay.

291
00:24:09,400 --> 00:24:09,960
Don't worry.

292
00:24:09,960 --> 00:24:10,960
Okay.

293
00:24:12,000 --> 00:24:13,000
Choose wisely.

294
00:24:21,119 --> 00:24:22,119
Shen Mo.

295
00:24:22,559 --> 00:24:23,719
What kind of car do you like?

296
00:24:24,039 --> 00:24:27,680
A sedan or an SUV...
or a sports car?

297
00:24:28,559 --> 00:24:29,920
It's really about what you like.

298
00:24:30,359 --> 00:24:31,240
I'm fine with anything

299
00:24:31,241 --> 00:24:32,681
I'm mainly here to keep you company.

300
00:24:33,359 --> 00:24:35,839
You think my brother
really wants to buy me a car.

301
00:24:36,160 --> 00:24:38,039
He wants to buy you one.

302
00:24:38,079 --> 00:24:39,479
But he's too embarrassed to say it.

303
00:24:39,640 --> 00:24:41,759
So he's using me as an excuse.

304
00:24:42,880 --> 00:24:43,680
Trust me.

305
00:24:43,839 --> 00:24:46,039
If you don't buy a car today,

306
00:24:46,079 --> 00:24:48,639
Tomorrow he'll just
hand you a set of car keys.

307
00:24:48,640 --> 00:24:50,480
And it'll be something insanely expensive.

308
00:24:50,519 --> 00:24:51,519
Hey.

309
00:24:51,599 --> 00:24:52,599
That one's nice.

310
00:24:54,000 --> 00:24:56,000
That does sound like Mr. Ji.

311
00:24:56,400 --> 00:24:57,599
But even after all this time

312
00:24:57,960 --> 00:25:00,000
I still can't figure out
what Mr. Ji is thinking.

313
00:25:08,079 --> 00:25:09,079
Zhou Yang.

314
00:25:09,119 --> 00:25:09,759
What are you doing here?

315
00:25:09,759 --> 00:25:10,759
An'an.

316
00:25:11,519 --> 00:25:13,079
My fiancée is picking out a car.

317
00:25:13,400 --> 00:25:14,640
Of course I had to come.

318
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:17,760
What about your family situation?

319
00:25:17,913 --> 00:25:18,913
And your cousin?

320
00:25:19,039 --> 00:25:20,719
Everything at home has been taken care of.

321
00:25:21,039 --> 00:25:22,759
He crossed the wrong person.

322
00:25:23,319 --> 00:25:24,758
Looks like he's in for a rough time.

323
00:25:24,759 --> 00:25:25,759
He certainly is.

324
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:28,039
My brother must've had
a reason for hitting him.

325
00:25:28,240 --> 00:25:29,200
Besides.

326
00:25:29,201 --> 00:25:31,335
You can tell just by looking
at him that he's bad news

327
00:25:31,359 --> 00:25:32,359
I agree.

328
00:25:33,039 --> 00:25:33,720
Forget it.

329
00:25:33,720 --> 00:25:34,720
Let's not talk about him.

330
00:25:34,920 --> 00:25:35,599
Come on.

331
00:25:35,599 --> 00:25:36,200
Let's go look at cars.

332
00:25:36,200 --> 00:25:37,200
Okay.

333
00:25:37,759 --> 00:25:38,000
Hey.

334
00:25:38,512 --> 00:25:39,592
Shen Mo, come with us.

335
00:25:42,240 --> 00:25:42,960
It's okay.

336
00:25:42,961 --> 00:25:44,118
You two go look around

337
00:25:44,119 --> 00:25:45,640
I'll browse on my own.

338
00:25:46,440 --> 00:25:47,200
It's fine.

339
00:25:47,200 --> 00:25:48,200
Come with us.

340
00:25:49,079 --> 00:25:50,079
Forget it.

341
00:25:50,359 --> 00:25:51,640
Let Shen Mo look on his own.

342
00:25:51,799 --> 00:25:54,079
He'll be too self-conscious
to choose with you around.

343
00:25:55,039 --> 00:25:55,839
Yeah.

344
00:25:55,880 --> 00:25:56,880
Good point.

345
00:25:57,440 --> 00:25:59,735
Then Shen Mo, make sure
you take a good look around.

346
00:25:59,759 --> 00:26:01,519
And don't you dare save
my brother any money.

347
00:26:04,160 --> 00:26:05,160
Let's go.

348
00:26:14,680 --> 00:26:15,680
Mr. Shen.

349
00:26:18,279 --> 00:26:19,039
Nice to meet you.

350
00:26:19,200 --> 00:26:20,800
My brother talks about you all the time.

351
00:26:22,759 --> 00:26:23,759
And you are...?

352
00:26:24,279 --> 00:26:25,279
Oh

353
00:26:25,559 --> 00:26:26,440
I just came back home.

354
00:26:26,441 --> 00:26:27,656
And I haven't bought a car yet.

355
00:26:27,680 --> 00:26:29,799
So I invited myself along with my brother.

356
00:26:31,839 --> 00:26:33,039
I'll let you get back to it

357
00:26:33,319 --> 00:26:34,640
I'm sure we'll meet again.

358
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:37,000
Right this way sir

359
00:26:37,359 --> 00:26:39,679
I should stay as far away
from the Zhou family as possible.

360
00:26:39,880 --> 00:26:40,920
And this Zhou Chu.

361
00:26:41,759 --> 00:26:43,400
There's something strange about him.

362
00:26:43,960 --> 00:26:44,960
Shen Mo.

363
00:26:49,240 --> 00:26:50,240
Shen Mo.

364
00:26:53,039 --> 00:26:54,039
Where's An'an?

365
00:26:54,119 --> 00:26:55,240
She went to the restroom.

366
00:26:55,720 --> 00:26:57,079
I need to talk to you.

367
00:26:57,720 --> 00:26:59,318
I have nothing to say to you.

368
00:26:59,319 --> 00:27:00,399
Did you forget?

369
00:27:00,400 --> 00:27:02,119
You just got engaged to Miss Ji yesterday.

370
00:27:03,200 --> 00:27:04,200
Shen Mo.

371
00:27:04,720 --> 00:27:06,119
I didn't have to come today.

372
00:27:06,480 --> 00:27:07,880
An'an told me you were here.

373
00:27:07,960 --> 00:27:09,318
So I came here just to see you.

374
00:27:09,319 --> 00:27:11,079
And I've already made
myself perfectly clear.

375
00:27:13,119 --> 00:27:14,319
Let's talk somewhere else.

376
00:27:15,880 --> 00:27:16,880
You're doing this again

377
00:27:17,240 --> 00:27:19,040
I have something really
important to tell you.

378
00:27:34,599 --> 00:27:35,879
What exactly do you want to say?

379
00:27:41,359 --> 00:27:42,359
Three years ago.

380
00:27:43,799 --> 00:27:45,000
When I went abroad...

381
00:27:46,039 --> 00:27:47,480
did something happen to you?

382
00:27:52,240 --> 00:27:53,480
It was too long ago.

383
00:27:53,920 --> 00:27:55,000
I don't remember anymore.

384
00:27:55,125 --> 00:27:56,565
You're still lying to me, aren't you?

385
00:27:57,240 --> 00:27:59,799
When Ji Mingxuan started that fight
yesterday I knew something was off.

386
00:28:00,319 --> 00:28:02,199
I had a feeling it had
something to do with you.

387
00:28:02,240 --> 00:28:03,518
Then after a lot of effort

388
00:28:03,519 --> 00:28:05,079
I got the truth out of my cousin.

389
00:28:06,039 --> 00:28:07,039
He said.

390
00:28:07,079 --> 00:28:08,519
He took some men to come after you.

391
00:28:08,920 --> 00:28:10,519
The same week I went abroad.

392
00:28:11,839 --> 00:28:14,720
So when I left the country,
What happened exactly?

393
00:28:15,039 --> 00:28:16,798
Why couldn't I reach you after I came back?

394
00:28:16,799 --> 00:28:17,839
Where were you?

395
00:28:18,160 --> 00:28:19,039
Was it because he hurt you?

396
00:28:19,039 --> 00:28:19,720
Is that why you...

397
00:28:19,721 --> 00:28:20,919
What's the point of talking about this now?

398
00:28:20,920 --> 00:28:21,960
Of course there's a point.

399
00:28:23,319 --> 00:28:25,118
I always thought your feelings had changed.

400
00:28:25,119 --> 00:28:26,535
And that was why you broke up with me.

401
00:28:26,559 --> 00:28:28,439
I always thought you only
cared about money and status.

402
00:28:28,440 --> 00:28:29,959
And that was why you got
together with Ji Mingxuan.

403
00:28:29,960 --> 00:28:31,318
But if that's not true.

404
00:28:31,319 --> 00:28:32,319
If...

405
00:28:32,880 --> 00:28:34,079
If that's not true...

406
00:28:36,079 --> 00:28:37,799
can you break up with Ji An'an?

407
00:28:39,319 --> 00:28:41,079
Can you call off your
engagement to Ji An'an?

408
00:28:42,119 --> 00:28:43,119
Can you?

409
00:28:45,079 --> 00:28:46,079
Do you dare?

410
00:28:53,592 --> 00:28:54,673
Haven't you ever wondered?

411
00:28:56,559 --> 00:28:58,640
Your cousin had no
personal grudge against me.

412
00:28:59,359 --> 00:29:00,720
So why would he come after me?

413
00:29:02,119 --> 00:29:03,599
He's just a thug fresh out of prison.

414
00:29:04,440 --> 00:29:09,040
Without someone ordering him, would he dare touch
the boyfriend of the heir to the Zhou family?

415
00:29:13,319 --> 00:29:14,880
You know exactly why.

416
00:29:16,640 --> 00:29:18,480
You just don't want to admit it.

417
00:29:21,559 --> 00:29:22,559
Your parents...

418
00:29:23,880 --> 00:29:27,759
or at least your mother
already knew about us.

419
00:29:29,680 --> 00:29:31,160
She sent people to threaten me.

420
00:29:33,400 --> 00:29:34,400
She told me...

421
00:29:35,880 --> 00:29:37,799
Never to appear in front of you again.

422
00:29:39,039 --> 00:29:40,039
Back then...

423
00:29:41,960 --> 00:29:43,599
why didn't you tell me back then?

424
00:29:48,400 --> 00:29:49,400
Forget about back then.

425
00:29:50,680 --> 00:29:51,720
Look at things now.

426
00:29:53,319 --> 00:29:54,880
An'an really cares about you.

427
00:29:57,279 --> 00:29:58,480
Don't let her down.

428
00:30:12,400 --> 00:30:13,920
I wanted to buy An'an a gift.

429
00:30:14,440 --> 00:30:16,319
But Zhou Yang beat me to it and paid.

430
00:30:17,440 --> 00:30:18,440
What about you?

431
00:30:18,920 --> 00:30:20,160
Did you find a car you like?

432
00:30:21,640 --> 00:30:23,279
I didn't see anything suitable.

433
00:30:25,240 --> 00:30:26,240
Oh.

434
00:30:31,839 --> 00:30:36,462
Don't tell me Mr. Ji went to a meeting at the
office today with that thing still stuck on him?

435
00:30:51,000 --> 00:30:52,079
Go wash up.

436
00:31:35,079 --> 00:31:36,079
Shen Mo.

437
00:31:37,480 --> 00:31:38,480
Yeah?

438
00:31:38,720 --> 00:31:39,720
You're still awake.

439
00:31:41,119 --> 00:31:42,239
I haven't fallen asleep yet.

440
00:31:50,279 --> 00:31:52,039
It'll just collect dust
in the garage anyway.

441
00:31:52,880 --> 00:31:54,440
Take it and drive it whenever you want.

442
00:31:58,000 --> 00:31:59,000
Thank you.

443
00:32:00,359 --> 00:32:01,359
Mingxuan.

444
00:32:03,000 --> 00:32:04,000
All right.

445
00:32:04,160 --> 00:32:05,160
Go to sleep.
